<title>UK: UK white sugar imports rose in September.</title>
<headline>UK white sugar imports rose in September.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK white sugar imports in tonnes issued by UK Customs - Cane or beet sugar and pure sucrose in solid form - flavouring or colouring.</p>
